  "notes": "12-step olive scale with a matching dark-mode scale. Steps 1-2: app and subtle backgrounds. 3-5: component backgrounds (normal, hover, pressed). 6-8: borders and focus rings. 9-10: solid backgrounds (e.g. buttons). 11-12: low and high contrast text.\n\nAlso available: oliveA (alpha) and P3 wide-gamut versions.\n\nUse: npm i @radix-ui/colors, then import \"@radix-ui/colors/olive.css\" and \"@radix-ui/colors/olive-dark.css\".\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/radix-ui/colors/blob/main/src/light.ts",
  "code": "<style>\n:root {\n  --olive-1: #fcfdfc;\n  --olive-2: #f8faf8;\n  --olive-3: #eff1ef;\n  --olive-4: #e7e9e7;\n  --olive-5: #dfe2df;\n  --olive-6: #d7dad7;\n  --olive-7: #cccfcc;\n  --olive-8: #b9bcb8;\n  --olive-9: #898e87;\n  --olive-10: #7f847d;\n  --olive-11: #60655f;\n  --olive-12: #1d211c;\n}\n.dark {\n  --olive-1: #111210;\n  --olive-2: #181917;\n  --olive-3: #212220;\n  --olive-4: #282a27;\n  --olive-5: #2f312e;\n  --olive-6: #383a36;\n  --olive-7: #454843;\n  --olive-8: #5c625b;\n  --olive-9: #687066;\n  --olive-10: #767d74;\n  --olive-11: #afb5ad;\n  --olive-12: #eceeec;\n}\n.scale { font: 12px system-ui, sans-serif; width: min(720px, 100%); }\n.scale p { margin: 12px 0 4px; color: #555; }\n.scale .row { display: grid; grid-auto-flow: column; grid-auto-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }\n.scale .row div { height: 48px; border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: end; padding: 4px; }\n.scale span { font-size: 10px; background: #fff9; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0 3px; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"scale\"><strong>Radix olive</strong>\n<p>light</p><div class=\"row\"><div style=\"background:#fcfdfc\" title=\"--olive-1: #fcfdfc\"><span>1</span></div><div style=\"background:#f8faf8\" title=\"--olive-2: #f8faf8\"><span>2</span></div><div style=\"background:#eff1ef\" title=\"--olive-3: #eff1ef\"><span>3</span></div><div style=\"background:#e7e9e7\" title=\"--olive-4: #e7e9e7\"><span>4</span></div><div style=\"background:#dfe2df\" title=\"--olive-5: #dfe2df\"><span>5</span></div><div style=\"background:#d7dad7\" title=\"--olive-6: #d7dad7\"><span>6</span></div><div style=\"background:#cccfcc\" title=\"--olive-7: #cccfcc\"><span>7</span></div><div style=\"background:#b9bcb8\" title=\"--olive-8: #b9bcb8\"><span>8</span></div><div style=\"background:#898e87\" title=\"--olive-9: #898e87\"><span>9</span></div><div style=\"background:#7f847d\" title=\"--olive-10: #7f847d\"><span>10</span></div><div style=\"background:#60655f\" title=\"--olive-11: #60655f\"><span>11</span></div><div style=\"background:#1d211c\" title=\"--olive-12: #1d211c\"><span>12</span></div></div>\n<p>dark</p><div class=\"row\"><div style=\"background:#111210\" title=\"--olive-1: #111210\"><span>1</span></div><div style=\"background:#181917\" title=\"--olive-2: #181917\"><span>2</span></div><div style=\"background:#212220\" title=\"--olive-3: #212220\"><span>3</span></div><div style=\"background:#282a27\" title=\"--olive-4: #282a27\"><span>4</span></div><div style=\"background:#2f312e\" title=\"--olive-5: #2f312e\"><span>5</span></div><div style=\"background:#383a36\" title=\"--olive-6: #383a36\"><span>6</span></div><div style=\"background:#454843\" title=\"--olive-7: #454843\"><span>7</span></div><div style=\"background:#5c625b\" title=\"--olive-8: #5c625b\"><span>8</span></div><div style=\"background:#687066\" title=\"--olive-9: #687066\"><span>9</span></div><div style=\"background:#767d74\" title=\"--olive-10: #767d74\"><span>10</span></div><div style=\"background:#afb5ad\" title=\"--olive-11: #afb5ad\"><span>11</span></div><div style=\"background:#eceeec\" title=\"--olive-12: #eceeec\"><span>12</span></div></div>\n</div>",
